            <ArticleTitle>Minimally invasive surgical approach for treatment of isolated endometrial cancer recurrence in an ultra-morbidly obese patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>820-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jmig.2011.08.720</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Herein is reported the first published case of an ultra-morbidly obese woman affected by an isolated pelvic recurrence of endometrial cancer, which was successfully treated via minimally invasive vaginal excision.</AbstractText>
